{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Ghost Code: Escape&quot; is the humble beginnings of a new saga. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a relatively simple 2D platformer. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Breezy Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most of the 18 stages can be completed in under 30 seconds, but mastering them can be a challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Art</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game doesn't use tiled environments. Every stage is handcrafted as a singular art piece.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Peek into a New World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story isn't front and center, but it is an origin of sorts for a big player in the world of Ghost Code.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It's 100% free, so give it a try.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Spark","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3935290/0a3726ab47fd44555f7acfa3b165687371e73cb3.jpg"},{"name":"Zookeeper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3935290/be57ed3396149c4d5f0db97cb0b3f1084c5b3e17.jpg"},{"name":"Hack the World","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3935290/d770996e205ba2da37bcd7f13a476c589e34db8c.jpg"},{"name":"Skelly","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3935290/45c39e10214e389a77d766fc19c6e524c6c8b07c.jpg"},{"name":"The Source","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3935290/e4e33850a707c832e4b9249f16271509f90516a5.jpg"},{"name":"Fast Tasks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3935290/e74876fbb4c90f570e2d7b85d91ab6a6be6f3482.jpg"},{"name":"Riddle Me This","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3935290/1b372a45f75e0c58667eb224abd86dce91707114.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3935290?t=1757684944","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935290/65fea149919734f7b8108c365cd3cc10729b0b3c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757684944","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935290/e611a9822e459b9d806322a33761f166dff815d3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757684944","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935290/e611a9822e459b9d806322a33761f166dff815d3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757684944","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Ghost Code: Escape&quot; is the humble beginnings of a new saga. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a relatively simple 2D platformer. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Breezy Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most of the 18 stages can be completed in under 30 seconds, but mastering them can be a challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Art</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game doesn't use tiled environments. Every stage is handcrafted as a singular art piece.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Peek into a New World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story isn't front and center, but it is an origin of sorts for a big player in the world of Ghost Code.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It's 100% free, so give it a try.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Crimson Equation"],"genres":[{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935290/8152ca471b0a5f8b9e1dcf87e25f4119965ab898/header.jpg?t=1757684944","is_free":true,"l